    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It's crazy how much a single invention can change the whole structure of a society. To wrap this up for my lecture, could you touch on the risks or the \"hidden costs\" of this interconnectedness? Like, were there downsides to having these systems so linked up? I want to give my students a balanced view of the era.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
